# Unattended-run state (read by project-trajectory/scripts/agent_loop.py via
# the root agent-resume.* launchers). RUNNING while work remains; a driver
# writes DONE / BLOCKED / NEEDS-HUMAN to end a walk-away run. NEEDS-HUMAN may
# carry one `ask:` line naming the act — the stop banner headlines it (WI-127).
# NOTE (OI-13, 2026-07-14): a `docs/pause` graceful stop deliberately leaves this
# file RUNNING — the pause signal is the exit-8 code + the stop banner, not this
# value; don't read RUNNING here as "not paused" when a `docs/pause` file may be
# present (PROCESS_OPTIONS "Unattended operation").
# NOTE (WI-180, 2026-07-16): SR-059 makes run-state a generated dispatcher
# outcome (RUNNING|NEEDS-HUMAN|BLOCKED|DONE); its generator lands with the
# dispatcher/integrator (Slices D/F). Until then the session writes it as before.
RUNNING
